                    <div
                      class="map2x-callout__body"
                    >
                      The MAP2 web GUI supports large-phone portrait and larger displays. The current minimum supported viewport is 
                      <span
                        class="map2x-mono"
                      >
                        560×917
                      </span>
                      . Heavily reduced browser windows are not supported.
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
